    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "urgent care is so expensive though and i'm really busy this week. is there any way i can just check this at home? like maybe if i drink some electrolytes or take some vitamins it'll clear up the smell? i really dont want to deal with a doctor right now if it's nothing.",
