    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but i feel fine otherwise, just a little tired. i really need a quick fix because i cant miss work. if i just take a bunch of metformin or something i find in my cabinet to bring my sugar down, would that work until i can go to a doctor next week? i just want to manage it myself for a few days.",
